job_post_detail.description:
1.Follow and improve the efficiency of Order Fulfillment Process and ensure on time delivery;
2.Follow shipment and revenue target achievement, analyze risks and opportunities;
3.Oversee HQ/Local/Channel inventory, prevent stock risks in advance and improve overall ITO;
4.Take part in setting up Regional Delivery KPIs, monitor and analyze periodically to improve operational efficiency;
5.Keep routinely and closely communication between HQ/Country/Customers to make sure all the delivery information is shared among all parties smoothly & efficiently.

job_post_detail.requirement:
1.Products delivery or related working experience preferred;
2.Bachelor degree (or above) in Supply Chain, Logistics, Business Administration or similar majors;
3.Data analytical and logical thinking;
4.Good communication skills, fluent in written and spoken English and Chinese required;
5.Entrepreneurial mindset, pro-active and problem solving attitude, hardworking and willing to work under pressure;
6.Fluent in spoken and written Spainish, English.
